&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking data science and machine learning models into production, maintaining them, and leading initiatives end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong machine learning and statistical expertise, including the ability to evaluate model performance rigorously against business metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in writing production-quality Python code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience querying and working with large datasets in cloud data warehouses such as BigQuery, including implementing data-quality checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building simulations or stochastic models of operational systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI coding agents, alongside the critical judgement to verify and test generated code and outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate effectively with software engineers, product managers, and diverse business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
