&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mathematical optimisation frameworks and toolkits, such as OR-Tools.&lt;/li&gt;
